---
title: Завдання 2. Сповіщення про зміни в афіші (Observer) — кінотеатр «Кадр»
---
classDiagram
    direction TB

    class Screening {
        <<Subject>>
        -String title
        -String time
        -List~SessionObserver~ observers
        +Screening(title String, time String)
        +subscribe(observer SessionObserver) void
        +unsubscribe(observer SessionObserver) void
        +reschedule(newTime String) void
        +cancel() void
        +openSales() void
        -notifyObservers(event SessionEvent) void
        +getTitle() String
        +getTime() String
    }

    class SessionObserver {
        <<interface>>
        <<Observer>>
        +update(screening Screening, event SessionEvent) void
        +getName() String
    }

    class SessionEvent {
        <<enumeration>>
        RESCHEDULED
        CANCELLED
        SALES_OPENED
    }

    class Website {
        <<ConcreteObserver>>
        +update(screening Screening, event SessionEvent) void
        +getName() String
    }
    class MobileApp {
        <<ConcreteObserver>>
        +update(screening Screening, event SessionEvent) void
        +getName() String
    }
    class TicketHolder {
        <<ConcreteObserver>>
        -String name
        +update(screening Screening, event SessionEvent) void
        +getName() String
    }
    class PremiereSubscriber {
        <<ConcreteObserver>>
        -String name
        +update(screening Screening, event SessionEvent) void
        +getName() String
    }

Screening o--> "0..*" SessionObserver : observers
Screening ..> SessionEvent : розсилає
SessionObserver ..> Screening : читає стан
SessionObserver ..> SessionEvent

SessionObserver <|.. Website
SessionObserver <|.. MobileApp
SessionObserver <|.. TicketHolder
SessionObserver <|.. PremiereSubscriber